_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/comments/4016858441/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/comments/4016880547","html_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/pull/963#issuecomment-4016880547","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/963","id":4016880547,"node_id":"IC_kwDOQ35BQ87vbLuj","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-07T16:40:06Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T16:40:06Z","body":"## ✅ Black Metal difficulty mode implemented\n\nThe implementation is complete and the PR is ready for review.\n\n### What was implemented\n\n**Issue #958** requested a \"Black Metal\" difficulty with:\n1. ✅ Player and enemies have **25% less HP**\n2. ✅ Player moves **25% faster**  \n3. ✅ Visual filter: **black-and-white + red** (red stays red, explosions/bullets/flashes stay vivid, everything else is grayscale)\n\n### How the visual filter works\n\nThe new `black_metal.gdshader` uses a post-processing screen-texture approach (same pattern as the ghost replay filter already in the codebase):\n\n- **Red-dominant pixels** (red channel significantly exceeds green and blue) → kept in vivid red  \n- **Warm/fiery pixels** (high combined red+green, low blue = orange/yellow tones) → kept in original color\n- **Everything else** → converted to high-contrast black-and-white\n\nThis preserves blood (red), explosions and muzzle flashes (orange/yellow), while desaturating the world, characters, and environment.\n\n### Implementation details\n\n- `BlackMetalEffectsManager` autoload applies the shader as a fullscreen `CanvasLayer` overlay and automatically enables/disables it when the difficulty changes via signal\n- Both GDScript (`player.gd`) and C# (`Player.cs`) players apply the HP and speed multipliers\n- Enemy HP is reduced in `_initialize_health()` in `enemy.gd`\n- 15 unit tests added to `test_difficulty_manager.gd`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/comments/4016880547/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/comments/4016882524","html_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/pull/963#issuecomment-4016882524","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/963","id":4016882524,"node_id":"IC_kwDOQ35BQ87vbMNc","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/oth